OL,3,GNEWSAHope for campaigners fighting for
OL,4,AGrade II barn
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners are hoping they could still
OL,7,Fbring a community arts space to a Grade
OL,8,FII listed 16th Century barn.
OL,10,FHeath Barn, believed to be one of the
OL,11,Foldest buildings in Boxmoor near Hemel
OL,12,FHempstead, was previously used as a
OL,13,Ffarm, theatre and music school.
OL,15,FThe Our Heath Barn group wanted to also
OL,16,Fhost outdoor markets there and convert
OL,17,Fanother part into homes.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
