OL,3,GNEWSAHope for campaigners fighting for
OL,4,AGrade II barn
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperty developer Curwen Group has
OL,7,Finstead been named as the preferred
OL,8,Fbidder, with plans to turn it into a
OL,9,Fnursery. But officers at Hertfordshire
OL,10,FCounty Council agreed to broker an
OL,11,Fintroduction between the company and
OL,12,Fthe campaigners.
